      "description": "Presentation of selected and inactive tabs; the application supplies roving focus and Left/Right/Home/End behavior.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Alphabet\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">Consonants</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Vowels</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Marks</button></div>",
